                                               moves ≈ 8·n² + 32·n·m              if ≈ 16·n·m < M and ≈ 2·B·i + 8·i < M
                 lower bound      moves 16·n·m                       (footprint, every distinct element crosses once)
                 footprint        c: [0, 8·n²)  a: [0, 8·n·m)  b: [0, 8·n·m)   resident after if ≈ 8·n² + 16·n·m < M
